cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Review questions for AI systems
message: >-
  If you use these review questions, please cite them as below.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Bossle
    given-names: Wolfgang
abstract: >-
  A two-language questionnaire (German and English in one document) for the
  sign-off of an AI system, grouped into Selection, Build, Operation and
  Evidence. Every question names what does not count as an answer. The
  derivation records, for every question, the certification objective it came
  from, and every deletion with its reason.
